# SolidJS Documentation

When implementing features, fixing bugs, or choosing patterns in this project, always refer to the official SolidJS documentation.

- **API reference**: https://docs.solidjs.com/reference
- **Guides**: https://docs.solidjs.com/guides
- **Tutorial**: https://docs.solidjs.com/tutorials

Prefer documented APIs and recommended patterns over third-party or framework-agnostic approaches. When in doubt, check the docs for the correct primitive or component pattern (e.g. `createSignal`, `createEffect`, `Show`, `For`, `Index`).
